<body>
  <h1>rec_sample_zkbiotime</h1>
  <p class="meta">共 9 个操作步骤，其中 2 个标签页切换。</p>
  <div class="tabs"><span class="tab">标签页 A：ZKBio TimeCloud 注册页 · biotimecloud.info</span><span class="tab">标签页 B：邮箱收件箱 · mail.example.com</span></div>
  <h2>操作步骤</h2>
  <article class="step">
  <h3>1. 点击 SIGN UP，进入ZKBio TimeCloud 注册表单页面</h3>
  <p><span class="kind">操作步骤</span></p>
  
  
  <p>点击 SIGN UP，进入ZKBio TimeCloud 注册表单页面。</p>
  
  <div class="shot"><img src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%221440%22%20height%3D%22900%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%201440%20900%22%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%221440%22%20height%3D%22900%22%20fill%3D%22%23eef3f8%22%2F%3E%3Crect%20x%3D%22258%22%20y%3D%22180%22%20width%3D%221024%22%20height%3D%22540%22%20rx%3D%2218%22%20fill%3D%22%23fff%22%20stroke%3D%22%23d5dde7%22%2F%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%22390%22%20y%3D%22285%22%20font-size%3D%2238%22%20font-weight%3D%22800%22%20fill%3D%22%231769aa%22%3EZKBio%20TimeCloud%3C%2Ftext%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%22390%22%20y%3D%22350%22%20font-size%3D%2228%22%20fill%3D%22%2318212b%22%3ESign%20in%20to%20your%20company%3C%2Ftext%3E%3Crect%20x%3D%22860%22%20y%3D%22520%22%20width%3D%22160%22%20height%3D%2244%22%20rx%3D%228%22%20fill%3D%22%231769aa%22%2F%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%22940%22%20y%3D%22550%22%20text-anchor%3D%22middle%22%20font-size%3D%2220%22%20font-weight%3D%22800%22%20fill%3D%22%23fff%22%3ESIGN%20UP%3C%2Ftext%3E%3Crect%20x%3D%22848%22%20y%3D%22508%22%20width%3D%22184%22%20height%3D%2268%22%20rx%3D%2210%22%20fill%3D%22none%22%20stroke%3D%22%23f18a2a%22%20stroke-width%3D%225%22%2F%3E%3Crect%20x%3D%2240%22%20y%3D%2232%22%20width%3D%22300%22%20height%3D%2244%22%20rx%3D%2222%22%20fill%3D%22%23ffffff%22%20opacity%3D%220.92%22%2F%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%2264%22%20y%3D%2262%22%20font-size%3D%2222%22%20font-weight%3D%22800%22%20fill%3D%22%23145985%22%3ESIGN%20UP%3C%2Ftext%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E" alt="步骤截图"><div class="focus" style="left:58.88888888888889%;top:56.44444444444444%;width:12.777777777777777%;height:7.555555555555555%"></div><div class="focus-zoom" style="left:71.94444444444444%;top:50.5%;width:19.444444444444446%;height:19.444444444444446%"><img src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%221440%22%20height%3D%22900%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%201440%20900%22%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%221440%22%20height%3D%22900%22%20fill%3D%22%23eef3f8%22%2F%3E%3Crect%20x%3D%22258%22%20y