</article>
<article class="step">
  <h3>2. 填写注册邮箱</h3>
  <p><span class="kind">操作步骤</span></p>
  
  
  <p>在 Email 输入框中填写注册邮箱，系统会通过该邮箱发送激活邮件。</p>
  <p class="warning">此步骤包含敏感字段，已脱敏。</p>
  <div class="shot"><img src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%221440%22%20height%3D%22900%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%201440%20900%22%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%221440%22%20height%3D%22900%22%20fill%3D%22%23eef3f8%22%2F%3E%3Crect%20x%3D%22250%22%20y%3D%2290%22%20width%3D%22940%22%20height%3D%22760%22%20rx%3D%2218%22%20fill%3D%22%23fff%22%20stroke%3D%22%23d5dde7%22%2F%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%22360%22%20y%3D%22170%22%20font-size%3D%2236%22%20font-weight%3D%22800%22%20fill%3D%22%231769aa%22%3EZKBio%20TimeCloud%3C%2Ftext%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%22360%22%20y%3D%22230%22%20font-size%3D%2228%22%20fill%3D%22%2318212b%22%3ECreate%20your%20account%3C%2Ftext%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%22780%22%20y%3D%22414%22%20font-size%3D%2220%22%20fill%3D%22%23475569%22%3EEmail%3C%2Ftext%3E%3Crect%20x%3D%22780%22%20y%3D%22430%22%20width%3D%22320%22%20height%3D%2242%22%20rx%3D%226%22%20fill%3D%22%23f8fafc%22%20stroke%3D%22%23cbd5e1%22%2F%3E%3Crect%20x%3D%22780%22%20y%3D%22500%22%20width%3D%22320%22%20height%3D%2242%22%20rx%3D%226%22%20fill%3D%22%23f8fafc%22%20stroke%3D%22%23cbd5e1%22%2F%3E%3Crect%20x%3D%22860%22%20y%3D%22620%22%20width%3D%22160%22%20height%3D%2244%22%20rx%3D%228%22%20fill%3D%22%231769aa%22%2F%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%22940%22%20y%3D%22650%22%20text-anchor%3D%22middle%22%20font-size%3D%2220%22%20font-weight%3D%22800%22%20fill%3D%22%23fff%22%3ESIGN%20UP%3C%2Ftext%3E%3Crect%20x%3D%22768%22%20y%3D%22418%22%20width%3D%22344%22%20height%3D%2266%22%20rx%3D%2210%22%20fill%3D%22none%22%20stroke%3D%22%23f18a2a%22%20stroke-width%3D%225%22%2F%3E%3Crect%20x%3D%2240%22%20y%3D%2232%22%20width%3D%22300%22%20height%3D%2244%22%20rx%3D%2222%22%20fill%3D%22%23ffffff%22%20opacity%3D%220.92%22%2F%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%2264%22%20y%3D%2262%22%20font-size%3D%2222%22%20font-weight%3D%22800%22%20fill%3D%22%23145985%22%3EEmail%3C%2Ftext%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E" alt="步骤截图"><div class="focus" style="left:53.333333333333336%;top:46.44444444444444%;width:23.88888888888889%;height:7.333333333333333%"></di