  <p class="coords">打码区域：x=780, y=430, width=320, height=42</p>
</article>
<article class="step">
  <h3>3. 打开标签页 B：邮箱收件箱</h3>
  <p><span class="kind">标签页切换</span></p>
  <div class="switch">标签页 A：ZKBio TimeCloud 注册页 -> 标签页 B：邮箱收件箱</div>
  
  <p>打开标签页 B：邮箱收件箱，查收账号激活邮件。</p>
  
  
  
  
</article>
<article class="step">
  <h3>4. 点击 Activate Account</h3>
  <p><span class="kind">操作步骤</span></p>
  
  
  <p>在邮箱中点击 Activate Account，激活刚注册的账号。</p>
  
  <div class="shot"><img src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%221440%22%20height%3D%22900%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%201440%20900%22%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%221440%22%20height%3D%22900%22%20fill%3D%22%23eef3f8%22%2F%3E%3Crect%20x%3D%22120%22%20y%3D%22110%22%20width%3D%221200%22%20height%3D%22690%22%20rx%3D%2218%22%20fill%3D%22%23fff%22%20stroke%3D%22%23d5dde7%22%2F%3E%3Crect%20x%3D%22120%22%20y%3D%22110%22%20width%3D%221200%22%20height%3D%2272%22%20rx%3D%2218%22%20fill%3D%22%231769aa%22%2F%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%22160%22%20y%3D%22156%22%20font-size%3D%2228%22%20font-weight%3D%22800%22%20fill%3D%22%23fff%22%3EMail%20Inbox%3C%2Ftext%3E%3Crect%20x%3D%22180%22%20y%3D%22260%22%20width%3D%221040%22%20height%3D%2292%22%20rx%3D%2210%22%20fill%3D%22%23f8fafc%22%20stroke%3D%22%23d5dde7%22%2F%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%22220%22%20y%3D%22316%22%20font-size%3D%2228%22%20fill%3D%22%2318212b%22%3EZKBio%20TimeCloud%20activation%20email%3C%2Ftext%3E%3Crect%20x%3D%22420%22%20y%3D%22360%22%20width%3D%22190%22%20height%3D%2238%22%20rx%3D%228%22%20fill%3D%22%231769aa%22%2F%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%22515%22%20y%3D%22386%22%20text-anchor%3D%22middle%22%20font-size%3D%2218%22%20font-weight%3D%22800%22%20fill%3D%22%23fff%22%3EActivate%20Account%3C%2Ftext%3E%3Crect%20x%3D%22408%22%20y%3D%22348%22%20width%3D%22214%22%20height%3D%2262%22%20rx%3D%2210%22%20fill%3D%22none%22%20stroke%3D%22%23f18a2a%22%20stroke-width%3D%225%22%2F%3E%3Crect%20x%3D%2240%22%20y%3D%2232%22%20width%3D%22300%22%20height%3D%2244%22%20rx%3D%2222%22%20fill%3D%22%23ffffff%22%20opacity%3D%220.92%22%2F%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%2264%22%20y%3D%2262%22%20font-size%3D%2222%22%20font-weight%3D%22800%22%20fill%3D%22%23145985%22%3EActivate%20Account%3C%2Ftext%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E" alt="步骤截图"><div class="focus" style="left:28.333333333333332%;top:38.666666666666664%;width:14.86111111111111%;height:6.888888888888889%"></div><div class="focus-zoom" style="left:43.47222222222222%;top:32.388888888888886%;width:19.444444444